    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your greenhouse by taking care of a plethora plants and decorating the place to your own taste. Unlock more information about your plants and spend your hard-earned money to buy new kinds of plants and new furniture to fill your greenhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Plants to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of decorations to give a unique look to your greenhouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about your plants as you care for them and manage their resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painterly Visual Style</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your greenhouse by taking care of a plethora plants and decorating the place to your own taste. Unlock more information about your plants and spend your hard-earned money to buy new kinds of plants and new furniture to fill your greenhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Plants to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of decorations to give a unique look to your greenhouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about your plants as you care for them and manage their resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painterly Visual Style</p></li></ul>",
